# Browser
# Abigale, Eloquent First-Year's trigger resolves on Bot2's Cecil, Dark Knight: it loses deathtouch and its Darkness ability,
# and has a flying, a first strike and a lifelink counter, whose keywords it has (CR 122.1b, 613.7c). Bot1's page shows the
# opponent's Cecil with the three counters across its art, its printed lines greyed as no longer its own, and the three
# keywords the counters give it after them.

